This is a game of chess written in lua using the Love2d framework. This is a work in progress. 

run 'love .' in the directory containint main.lua to start the game.

Development Notes:
* peice.location and peice.target are the main points of manipulation
    drag and drop works by detecting the closest square and setting it
    as the target. The move is then validated and executed.
    
    peice.target can be manipulated by text input eventually. 
    this will drive the game loop in the same way that drag and drop does

